-- coa7-ch6.l4: Part 13 Chapter 6, Records of resolutions and meetings (ss 355 to 359), lines 4553-4597 of
-- ukpga-2006-46.txt. Layer 1: the law, objectively. Tag conventions are those of coa7-ch1.l4.
